# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets
.env
.env.*.local

# Derived copy of assets/images, rebuilt by `npm run mirror:media`.
#
# The same 337 images were sitting in three places on disk. assets/images is the
# tracked copy — it is what wildkumaun/src/scripts/import-media.ts reads when it
# creates Payload Media documents, so it is the one that outlives the mirror.
# wildkumaun/public/media is what Next serves today; it is a copy, so tracking it
# too would put the same 141M in git twice.
wildkumaun/public/media/

# Local tooling noise
_tools/fetch.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Accessibility scan output.
#
# Regenerated by `npm run a11y:baseline` and by the plugin's Run scan, and the
# plugin now keeps its history in the database — which is the copy anyone would
# actually go back to. Tracking these as well would add a few hundred KB of
# screenshots and near-identical JSON on every run.
wildkumaun/reports/
